{
  "mq": {
    "backend": "rocketmq",
    "protocol": "http",
    "host": "http://1756405205604856.mqrest.cn-qingdao-public.aliyuncs.com",
    "port": 80,
    "instance_id": "MQ_INST_1756405205604856_BX7N4khY",
    "access_key": "",
    "secret_key": "",
    "topic": "JS_PROD_MQ",
    "tag": "CLOCK_RECORD_CREATE",
    "group": "GID_FEISHU_DIRECT_SYNC",
    "use_tls": false,
    "max_consecutive_errors": 5
  },
  "feishu": {
    "app_id": "",
    "app_secret": "",
    "app_token": "",
    "table_id": "",
    "table_name": "",
    "timeout": 15
  },
  "batch": {
    "window_seconds": 3,
    "max_batch_size": 500,
    "consume_batch": 16,
    "wait_seconds": 3
  },
  "sync": {
    "enabled": true,
    "map_keep_days": 7,
    "retry": 3,
    "retry_backoff": 2.0
  },
  "rename": {
    "employeeName": "memberName",
    "idCard": "identificationNumber",
    "employeeId": "memberId",
    "project": "projectName",
    "team": "teamName",
    "supplier": "supplierName",
    "category": "categoryName",
    "phone": "telephone",
    "clockTime": "punchTime",
    "signTime": "punchTime",
    "signInTime": "punchTime",
    "attendTime": "punchTime",
    "checkinTime": "punchTime",
    "punchDateTime": "punchTime",
    "firstPunchTime": "punchTime",
    "lastPunchTime": "punchTime",
    "打卡时间": "punchTime",
    "打卡日期": "punchTime"
  },
  "notes": [
    "1. 【必做前置】阿里云 RocketMQ 控制台 → 消费者组 → 新建 GID_FEISHU_DIRECT_SYNC。不创建会报 AccessDenied: resource ... not created。",
    "2. 【重要】mq.group 必须与现有 MQ 桥接（GID_INSURANCE_AGENT_PROCESS）不同，否则两条链路互相抢消息。",
    "3. 密钥不要写在这里 —— 走 .env 环境变量：ROCKETMQ_ACCESS_KEY / ROCKETMQ_SECRET_KEY / FEISHU_APP_ID / FEISHU_APP_SECRET / FEISHU_APP_TOKEN。",
    "4. feishu.table_id 与 table_name 二选一：填 table_name 则按表名自动查 ID。",
    "5. batch.window_seconds 是攒批窗口：ERP 逐条推送，攒批后一次性写飞书（避开 10 QPS 限制）。",
    "6. 幂等映射文件 feishu_direct_sync_map.json 自动生成，记录 日期+身份证号 → 飞书 record_id。"
  ]
}
